# Tabletop Roleplaying Games

One of the big subjects here at TOI is tabletop roleplaying games. I like a wide variety of genres for the most part, but mostly Sci-Fi, Fantasy (with a preference for grimdark and grimbright (yeah, that's a thing)), and "Silly" settings (i.e. the little known Ninja Burger RPGs and the "zap" flavor of the Paranoia RPG). 



